      "contract": "Session-derived owner; explicit file selection/owner/destination consent; strict version/hash/item provenance with stable operation+UUID mapping and request digest persisted before mutation; title >120 stays full objective; existing remember/CAS for history and draft workflow only. Owner+operation same digest returns same IDs; other digest409; other owner denied. Lost response GET original ID+digest/revision; UNKNOWN blocks retry; restart reconciles mapping. Logout invalidates pending. Delete originals only future explicit user action after full readback.",
